Introducing Crossword Dictionary App - the quickest, easiest way to find answers to any crossword puzzle on your iPhone or iPad. 

The App runs offline when searching for words.

The following South African magazines works fine with this App; YOU, Home, Puzzle Mania, Woman&Home, Fair Lady, Drum, TV-Plus and the Go.

With over more than 200 337 unique clues (with more than 314 301 unique combinations of clue and answer) and 5 different search methods finding the correct answer, has just become so much faster and easier than paging and squinting through pages in a physical book.

The 5 search methods allow you to look for an answer by:
- Using the clue provided;
- Looking through groups of answers such as chemical elements or abbreviations;
- Combined search of the clue and answer using a word;
- Looking at different answer lengths;
- Entering the characters you already have to find words that will fit into the space provided.

Included in the App are Anagram-, 3x3 Puzzle- and Wheel Puzzle solvers.

You can also enter random letters and get all the words (Anagram) that contain these letters. This is useful to get the answer for the question that many crosswords require you to send, as well as solving an Anagram Crossword.

Disclaimer: This app does not have ALL the clues as yet, you can assist the growth of the app by adding new clues and answers which will be emailed to the developer for adding to the database, so that other users can all so see the newly added data.
